{"spec_version":"behavior-chain@0.1","id":"behavior.starryos.cgroup.cpu-enforcement-boundary","run_id":"run.starryos.cgroup.001","project_ref":{"repo":"https://github.com/rcore-os/tgoskits","commit":"fc80b868fb3640efe8997994de42c1aee8fd74cb"},"status":"candidate","input_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.cpu-files","fact.starryos.cgroup.controller-framework","fact.starryos.cgroup.kernel-integration"],"claims":[{"id":"claim.behavior.cpu-enforcement-boundary","statement":"cpu.max 写入会更新带宽状态，boot 会注册 tick hook，tick 会计费并设置任务 throttled 标志；固定 commit 没有调度器读取该标志，cpu.weight 也只有转换 helper 与宿主测试，因此真实 CPU enforcement 尚未闭环","epistemic_status":"supported_inference","source_refs":["src.axcgroup.cpu-rs","src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"anchor_refs":["anchor.starryos.cpu-write-max","anchor.starryos.kernel-cgroup-init","anchor.starryos.kernel-bandwidth-tick","anchor.starryos.task-is-throttled","anchor.starryos.task-set-throttled"],"method":"trace","validity":{"commit_bound":true,"invalidates_on":["anchor_change","behavior_change","reference_search_change"]}}],"created_by":{"actor_type":"agent","actor_id":"codex"},"content_hash":"e5d4f85af63a7b466e8238a9f940e2258e47c5aac55350583abcc164e09f6ef2","created_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00+08:00","behavior_kind":"state_change","title":"cpu 配置、tick 计费与调度消费边界","preconditions":["cpu controller 已在目标节点启用","调用者通过 cgroupfs 写入合法 cpu.max 或 cpu.weight","StarryOS boot 已执行 cgroup::init"],"entry":"write_attr 路由到 CpuController；scheduler timer tick 调用 kernel bandwidth_tick","state":{"reads":["CpuState.cfs_quota/cfs_period/weight","BandwidthState.quota/period/consumed/period_start","current task cgroup","TaskInner.throttled"],"writes":["CpuState 与 BandwidthState 配置","BandwidthState consumed/nr_periods/nr_throttled","TaskInner.throttled"]},"success_exit":"配置读写、period 计费和 throttled 标志更新在固定源码中存在；没有调度器消费证据时不得把该出口写成实际限速成功","failure_exit":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"非法 weight、quota 或 period 返回 InvalidInput，cpu.stat 写入返回 OperationNotPermitted；无 cpu controller 或无限 quota 时 tick 直接返回"},"cleanup":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"period rollover 清零 consumed 并清除当前任务标志；固定 commit 未证明其他已标记任务如何恢复，也未证明 scheduler 会跳过 throttled task"},"invariants":["配置状态、计费状态与调度执行效果必须分栏","throttled 标志只有写入者而无调度器读取者时不能视为 enforcement","cpu.weight helper 仅在宿主测试使用时不能视为调度权重已下发","多核同时 tick 同一 cgroup 时 period rollover 必须保持计数一致"],"concurrency":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"BandwidthState 使用原子字段，但 period_start 检查和 reset 由多步 load/store 组成；设计审核需覆盖多核 tick 交错与重复 nr_periods/nr_throttled"},"anchors":[{"id":"anchor.starryos.cpu-write-max","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/cpu.rs","symbol":"CpuController::write_cpu_max","role":"cpu.max 状态提交"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.kernel-cgroup-init","path":"os/StarryOS/kernel/src/cgroup/mod.rs","symbol":"init","role":"tick hook 注册"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.kernel-bandwidth-tick","path":"os/StarryOS/kernel/src/cgroup/cpu.rs","symbol":"bandwidth_tick","role":"period 计费与 throttle 标志写入"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.task-is-throttled","path":"os/arceos/modules/axtask/src/task.rs","symbol":"TaskInner::is_throttled","role":"无 scheduler 调用者的读取 API"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.task-set-throttled","path":"os/arceos/modules/axtask/src/task.rs","symbol":"TaskInner::set_throttled","role":"tick hook 写入 API"}],"evidence_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.cpu-files"],"coverage_refs":["coverage.cgroup.cpu"]}
{"spec_version":"behavior-chain@0.1","id":"behavior.starryos.cgroup.memory-charge-boundary","run_id":"run.starryos.cgroup.001","project_ref":{"repo":"https://github.com/rcore-os/tgoskits","commit":"fc80b868fb3640efe8997994de42c1aee8fd74cb"},"status":"candidate","input_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.memory-file","fact.starryos.cgroup.membership","fact.starryos.cgroup.kernel-integration"],"claims":[{"id":"claim.behavior.memory-charge-boundary","statement":"公开 memory charge API 能沿祖先路径原子计费、超限回滚并在迁移/退出时转移或释放，宿主测试覆盖这些事务；固定 commit 的页分配与释放路径没有调用这些 API，所以生产 memory enforcement 为 partial","epistemic_status":"supported_inference","source_refs":["src.axcgroup.memory-rs","src.axcgroup.libr-rs","src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"anchor_refs":["anchor.starryos.cgroup.memory-rs","anchor.starryos.try-charge-memory","anchor.starryos.uncharge-memory","anchor.starryos.memory-charge-test"],"method":"trace","validity":{"commit_bound":true,"invalidates_on":["anchor_change","behavior_change","reference_search_change"]}}],"created_by":{"actor_type":"agent","actor_id":"codex"},"content_hash":"55fa9e289953d7b534c10082ac36f50c688f8aa8dec4f637dc876bf0eeb66a6a","created_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00+08:00","behavior_kind":"state_change","title":"memory 分层计费 API 与页分配接入边界","preconditions":["memory controller 已沿目标祖先路径启用","pid 已绑定到可查询的 cgroup","调用者知道实际分配或释放字节数"],"entry":"外部调用者执行 try_charge_memory 或 uncharge_memory；迁移和退出复用 charged_mem 账本","state":{"reads":["provider.get_cgroup(pid)","cgroup ancestor path","MemoryState.max/current","MembershipState.charged_mem"],"writes":["每层 MemoryState.current","MemoryState.events_max","MembershipState.charged_mem"]},"success_exit":"宿主 API 调用可完成祖先分层计费、释放、迁移转账和退出清理；没有页分配器生产调用者时只能证明机制 API，不能证明应用内存被限制","failure_exit":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"任一祖先超过 memory.max 时该层 events.max 增加，已计费祖先回滚并返回 StorageFull；未知 pid 或未初始化返回错误"},"cleanup":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"uncharge 使用 recorded total 饱和释放；迁移只移动 unique path 的总 charge；exit 释放全部记录，评审需防止重复释放和遗漏分配"},"invariants":["一次成功分配的字节数在所有启用 memory 的祖先各计一次","任一层拒绝时所有先前 charge 必须回滚","释放不得超过 MembershipState 记录的 pid 总量","宿主测试通过不能代替页分配器/释放器生产接入"],"concurrency":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"公开 API 在 MEMBERSHIP 锁内串行账本更新，MemoryState 使用 CAS；设计审核需检查真实 allocator 若在锁上下文调用会否形成锁序或阻塞问题"},"anchors":[{"id":"anchor.starryos.cgroup.memory-rs","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/memory.rs","symbol":null,"role":"memory limit 与原子计费状态"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.try-charge-memory","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/lib.rs","symbol":"try_charge_memory","role":"祖先路径计费与 pid 账本"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.uncharge-memory","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/lib.rs","symbol":"uncharge_memory","role":"按账本饱和释放"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.memory-charge-test","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/tests/memory_charge.rs","symbol":null,"role":"宿主 charge/rollback/migrate/exit 测试"}],"evidence_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.memory-file","fact.starryos.cgroup.membership"],"coverage_refs":["coverage.cgroup.memory","coverage.cgroup.kernel-integration"]}
