务 affinity，也因此没有运行任务迁移/恢复闭环"},"invariants":["child effective 必须等于 parent effective 与 own request 的交集","父节点变化必须传播到全部后代","effective 为空与任务无法调度的策略必须显式定义","配置掩码更新不能被表述为任务 affinity 已生效","固定 commit 不写现有任务或新任务 affinity"],"concurrency":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"掩码为原子字段，递归期间逐个锁 children 快照；设计审核需覆盖层级创建/删除与父子同时写掩码的交错一致性"},"anchors":[{"id":"anchor.starryos.cgroup.cpuset-rs","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/cpuset.rs","symbol":null,"role":"掩码解析和 controller 状态"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.recompute-cpuset-effective","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/lib.rs","symbol":"recompute_cpuset_effective","role":"父子交集递归传播"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.cpuset-logic-test","path":"components/ax-cgroup/src/tests/cpuset_logic.rs","symbol":null,"role":"宿主层级传播测试"},{"id":"anchor.starryos.task-affinity-api","path":"os/arceos/modules/axtask/src/api.rs","symbol":null,"role":"已有但未接 cpuset 的任务 affinity API"}],"evidence_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.cpuset-file"],"coverage_refs":["coverage.cgroup.cpuset","coverage.cgroup.kernel-integration"]}
{"spec_version":"behavior-chain@0.1","id":"behavior.starryos.cgroup.io-persistence-boundary","run_id":"run.starryos.cgroup.001","project_ref":{"repo":"https://github.com/rcore-os/tgoskits","commit":"fc80b868fb3640efe8997994de42c1aee8fd74cb"},"status":"candidate","input_refs":["fact.starryos.cgroup.io-file","fact.starryos.cgroup.controller-framework","fact.starryos.cgroup.kernel-integration"],"claims":[{"id":"claim.behavior.io-persistence-boundary","statement":"io.max 会先解析全部行再按设备 upsert 并可 round-trip，io.weight 也能保存；固定源码明确声明 rdif-block 没有可安装 token bucket 的队列层，IoState 无块层消费者，因此配置存在但真实 I/O 节流 absent","epistemic_status":"supported_inference","source_refs":["src.axcgroup.io-rs","src.starryos.cgroup-kernel-rs"],"anchor_refs":["anchor.starryos.cgroup.io-rs","anchor.starryos.io-upsert","anchor.starryos.io-roundtrip-test"],"method":"trace","validity":{"commit_bound":true,"invalidates_on":["anchor_change","behavior_change","reference_search_change"]}}],"created_by":{"actor_type":"agent","actor_id":"codex"},"content_hash":"2f1cec7736519732a68409a6383c0e0fe2fb57f82318dc247ad0fe8985936076","created_at":"2026-08-17T00:00:00+08:00","behavior_kind":"state_change","title":"io 限额持久化与块层节流缺口","preconditions":["io controller 已在目标节点启用","调用者写合法 io.weight 或 device-keyed io.max","目标设备号仅作为配置键使用"],"entry":"write_attr 路由到 IoController，io.max 先解析全部非空行再更新 limits","state":{"reads":["IoState.weight","IoState.limits","io.max 输入行"],"writes":["IoState.weight","按 major:minor 键保存的 rbps/wbps/riops/wiops"]},"success_exit":"合法配置可保存、同设备局部更新并稳定读回；固定 commit 不改变实际块设备吞吐或优先级","failure_exit":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"非法设备号、未知 key、非法数值或 weight 范围返回 InvalidInput；因为全部行先解析，失败不会产生部分配置"},"cleanup":{"applicability":"applicable","description":"非法多行输入在任何 upsert 前返回，limits 保持原值；当前没有运行时节流器、等待队列或 token 生命周期可清理，这一缺口单独记录为 absent"},"invariants":["同一设备后续写入只更新显式字段","多行任一解析失败时 limits 保持不变","配置 round-trip 不等于 I/O enforcement","测试来源必须注明 Linux cgroup selftests 缺少独立 io 专用 C 用例","固定 commit 不写块设备请求队列、token bucket 或 I/